abstract: >-
  Data and analysis code for a manuscript on slip-stick dynamics in butyl
  pressure-sensitive adhesive and silicone release-liner systems. The archive
  contains datasets from modified FINAT FTM 10-type 180 degree release-liner
  peel integration tests, the canonical generator used for release-force tables
  and figures, locked-environment requirements, and generated publication
  outputs.
